"value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-29T09:04:28-07:00","id":1446446,"title":"","content":"Interestingly they are protected by these Shadow Shark things. In Polynesian myth Sharks are protecter Spirts. Which is nice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-29T22:03:39-07:00","id":1446557,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arzie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/1446201-non-australian-oceania-dark-kingdom#post1446201\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know there's a Dark Kingdom for Australia, but it sounds as though it's a different animal altogether from the rest of Oceania (Micronesia, Polynesia, etc.) Is there a separate Dark Kingdom for the South Seas? Would it just be a bunch of small, independent City-State Necropoli? Would they mostly be centred in the Shadowlands? Would it be Stygia-controlled lands if they were held as colonies by Western nations? Any thoughts would be appreciated. Thanks! :^)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> As stated by othersThe Oceanic Dark Kingdom is Polynesian.<br /> <br /> Of Australian First Nations Dark Kingdoms, Karta is the largest and most known outside its borders, Its referred to as The Dark Kingdom of Clay by Stygians. The major cities each house seperate Stygian outpost Necropoli.....though outside of Sydney and Melbourne its a bit of a toss up whether the Hierachy, Renegades or Heretics are actually in charge of them. There are also sizable Dark Kingdom of Jade holdfasts in each city.<br /> <br /> Karta ( <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Karta\" target=\"_blank\">https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Karta</a> )seems to mostly be based on Western Desert concepts of death ( though it takes its name from a South Australian indigenous belief: <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b><i>Karta Pintingka</i></b><span style=\"color:#3E3E3E\"><span style=\"font-family:Quattrocento\">is the Kaurna name for Kangaroo Island. Kaurna call the eastern side of the island </span></span><i>Karta</i><span style=\"color:#3E3E3E\"><span style=\"font-family:Quattrocento\"> and the western side of the island is called </span></span><i>Pintingka</i></span><span style=\"color:#3E3E3E\"><span style=\"font-family:Quattrocento\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> that means &quot;the place of the dead&quot;</span>. </span></span>) and the afterlife and its likely there are smaller fragmented Kingdoms scattered around the ' continent ' that reflect other cultural realities.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26564-badfurryfanfic","name":"BadFurryFanFic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"93"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-11T05:05:01-07:00","id":1448208,"title":"","content":"Thanks all. I've been checking out the PG and it was exactly what I was looking for. Thanks so much!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Hosting <a href=\"http://opx-finalfrontier.wikidot.com\" target=\"_blank\">